  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0eedf6eb28a05ae",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 的张量并行要求模型架构中的若干数值能够被选用于张量并行的 GPU 数量整除。这通常意味着，你只能使用数量为二的幂的 GPU（2、4、8 等）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a36dd0692e4efdc",
      "translationZh": "我有六块 GPU，想在运行一个 27B 模型时尽可能增大 KV 缓存。所以我试了 tp=6。结果它报了各种错误，说这个或那个数值需要能被六整除，但实际上不能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa9acd2e280fbfd8",
      "translationZh": "于是我把那些数值改成了能被六整除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e363b19e7fadc35",
      "translationZh": "我让机器人写一个转换器，读取原始模型，并用零填充，直到所有数值都能被 6 整除。试了几次之后，还真成功了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19f35cac1e144374",
      "translationZh": "我在六块 7900 XTX GPU 上运行 BF16 精度的 Qwen 3.8 27B，上下文窗口为 256k。单用户时，Token 生成速度约为 50 t/s；同时处理 8 个提示时，总速度约为 200 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d91d8b6d7fe212da",
      "translationZh": "GPU KV 缓存大小：520,784 个 token；每个请求为 262,144 个 token 时的最大并发度：1.99x",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71496ceaded8e277",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Biomass23 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
